messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nA man is either kind or evil. No ugly person is handsome. All evil people are ugly. All gentlemen are handsome. All CEOs are gentlemen. Harry is a gentleman.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Harry is kind or a CEO.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '1.Harry is a gentleman.(Given).\n2.All gentlemen are handsome.(Given).\n3.Harry is a gentleman.(From step 1).\n4.Therefore, Harry is handsome.(From step 2 and step 3).\n5.All CEOs are gentlemen.(Given).\n6.Harry is a gentleman.(From step 1).\n7.Therefore, Harry is a CEO.(From step 5 and step 6).\n8.All evil people are ugly.(Given).\n9.All ugly people are not handsome.(Given).\n10.Therefore, all evil people are not handsome.(From step 8 and step 9).\n11.Harry is a gentleman.(From step 1).\n12.Therefore, Harry is not evil.(From step 10 and step 11).\n13.All evil people are not handsome.(From step 12).Therefore, Harry is neither kind nor a CEO.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
